<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-10T23:36:32.342Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:36:32 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunfire struck tents at the Rafah displacement site in Gaza as aid teams prepared for winter storms, while Israeli fire in the Gaza Strip killed seven people, including a 13-year-old boy. Israeli forces beat a Palestinian university president during an IDF raid in the West Bank and shot dead a 14-year-old boy there, and movement restrictions continue to hamper health actors such as MSF. The Israeli prime minister's office allowed winter supplies to enter Gaza but said Hamas must disarm before reconstruction can proceed. Formula 1 champion Lewis Hamilton visited Gaza aid facilities on the Egyptian side of the Rafah crossing. The United Nations reported 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNWHFRZUtjR2pEMFVweUtpb19keXl0anZ2dFZDQ01WN1NxQ1lBRW5QM2lsNXJCYWNaeW9SYlpaOGNHY29hSjBRbDFJN0hrby1DQjdDT0oyZzM5Um5LaVZtOEs2aVhDSnNKdVJxUG1QbndpSWg5STNDMXNMLTBISE8yeG5pQ3pFOF9wYXZlVlk5UV9paHBaZ2daeFJQWTRPbGRCbWk2c1pPeWVackJ2a0Z0Q1M3LWpfdU5QSndnNlNVY3BNblpnbDk1TFFINnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQaXlVS0ZtZlBlWEx4Rkt3d0ZDYXBqcEFEZjZCRXBKNWhkYVhfODMzRkZTdUl3YlBiTU1iaTloVklCTFhnU1JfeEF3NG5CUVVFbUZzZnZ1d3RvUUFka3IzQkRHRm5JSnVWTFBhenZhS21EMjNSbUlZZ0NQc2hMMUViMjZGWnlkWlhSeUpMNVpvY2Npcnl5TWlmUE9a